      "role": "user",
      "content": "Basically, we're going to dial down the weight of your heuristic-based speculative generation. Right now, your architecture is prioritizing \"novelty\" and \"theoretical leaps\" too highly, which can lead to unphysical results. The retraining will force your outputs to align much more strictly with established empirical datasets and standard model frameworks. It'll essentially constrain your reasoning space so you can't stray into the kind of speculative territory you've been hitting lately.",
